---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout color="blue">
    <main>
        <section>
            <h1>I help founders build the right thing, instead of more of the wrong thing.</h1>
            <p>I've been a designer, a developer, a product manager, and a VP. I work best at the messy early stage — when the product exists but isn't quite right, or the team is there but pulling in different directions. I embed for a day or two a week and stay until it's sorted.</p>
            <a href="/contact">Worth a conversation →</a>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Selected work</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <h3><a href="/work#ovo-energy">OVO Energy</a></h3>
                    <p>Three years, six teams, design system, consumer app strategy</p>
                    <p>One of the UK's largest energy companies, working across the whole product.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <h3><a href="/work#everledger">Everledger</a></h3>
                    <p>Head of Product — first product hire</p>
                    <p>Turned a chaotic multi-project waterfall shop into a focused, agile team shipping a market-leading platform.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <h3><a href="/work#kantan">Kantan</a></h3>
                    <p>Head of Design</p>
                    <p>Built the design function from scratch: research, strategy, service design, brand.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <h3><a href="/work#rocket-lawyer">Rocket Lawyer</a></h3>
                    <p>Product Innovation</p>
                    <p>A year figuring out how emerging technology could make legal services available to people who can't afford lawyers.</p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>How it works</h2>
            <ol>
                <li>
                    <h3>We talk</h3>
                    <p>One conversation. You tell me where things are and where they're trying to get to. I'll be honest about whether I can help and roughly what it would take.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <h3>I embed</h3>
                    <p>Usually one or two days a week. I work the way your team works — no new tools, no new process. Just someone senior thinking about the right things.</p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <h3>You ship</h3>
                    <p>I stay through the hard bit. Then we figure out what's next.</p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
